391-## 12. Phase 0 verification record (2026-08-04)
392-
393-- Backend: `venv` was broken (base interpreter from another project, missing). Rebuilt on Python 3.10.0; requirements + pytest installed. Initial run exposed a real false positive in the watermark confidence gate: the clean radial-glow regression had brightness difference 8.82, while the weakest real watermark fixture was about 17. Raising `_BRIGHTNESS_DIFF_MIN` from 8 to 10 preserves the real fixtures and fixes the false positive. Current `pytest tests/ -q`: **14 passed, 2 subtests passed**.
